# Build outputs (recursive: bare "obj/" only matches the repo root, so a
# Windows-built src/TextBox/obj/project.assets.json would leak into the
# image, overwrite the Linux restore output on COPY, and break the build
# with NETSDK1064 — see dotnet/sdk#37291).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/TestResults/

# Frontend install (reinstalled with npm ci during docker build)
**/node_modules/

# Local/runtime data (the dev DB lives at src/TextBox/Data/, not the root)
**/Data/
*.db

# VCS / CI / IDE
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
